<title>UK: TENNIS-WIMBLEDON MEN'S SINGLES LATEST - RUSEDSKI BEATEN.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WIMBLEDON MEN'S SINGLES LATEST - RUSEDSKI BEATEN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Latest scores in the men's singles</p>
<p>quarter-finals at Wimbledon on Thursday (prefix denotes seeding)</p>
<p>Greg Rusedski (Britain) v Cedric Pioline (France)</p>
<p>Pioline won 6-4 4-6 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Nicolas Kiefer (Germany) v Todd Woodbridge (Australia)</p>
<p>Woodbridge leads  7-6(9-7) 2-6 6-0 1-0 fourth set</p>
<p>Playing later:</p>
<p>1-Pete Sampras (U.S.) v 8-Boris Becker (Germany)</p>
<p>14-Tim Henman (Britain) v Michael Stich (Germany)</p>
</text>
